{"id":"759560c3675c3177","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-opendense.md","title":"Open Dense Set","display":"df-opendense — Open Dense Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-opendense","aliases":["58-df-opendense"],"display":"df-opendense — Open Dense Set","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-opendense"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-opendense</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-opendense — Open Dense Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,D,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,D,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (order-density predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenDense}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenDense}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (open-dense predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}opendense} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenDense}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_Pp\\to q\\in D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}opendense} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenDense}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall p\\in D\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_Pp\\to q\\in D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is an explicit argument and the call to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span> has the exact upstream arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,P,\\leq_P)\">\\((D,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)$ (order-density predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,D,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenDense}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}opendense} \\vdash \\mathrm{OpenDense}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\fora